'''Gift Compass''' is an {{Uncommon}} item used in {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}} to find unfound {{LI|White Gift}}s.

== Obtaining ==
=== Chicken Race ===
A '''Gift Compass''' can be obtained as a reward from the [[Chicken Race]] by reaching Cluckpoint 2. 

=== Shop Purchase ===
After being obtained from the [[Chicken Race]], the '''Gift Compass''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Rusty}} for {{Coins|1,000}}.

== Usage ==
The '''Gift Compass''' points towards the nearest [[Gift]] that has not been found on {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}. If the player has already found the gift it points to, they must hold it again in order to get the compass to point in the direction, but only if they are not directly holding it. Otherwise, it automatically resets. This process can repeat multiple times until the compass finds a gift that has not already been found. 

When holding the compass after finding the gift it points to, it shows a message in the chat, saying either that all the gifts have been found or that the compass is pointing in the direction of a new gift. 

